Implemented the change:

- `httpx/_urls.py`: Query params now use `urllib.parse.urlencode` with the WHATWG query safe set, encoding spaces as `+`.
- `httpx/_urlparse.py`: Removed the custom `urlencode` helper and made quoting helpers require an explicit safe set.
- `tests/models/test_url.py`: Updated query/form encoding expectations and added coverage for `+` form spaces and safe `/`.

Verified with `python -m pytest tests/models/test_url.py tests/models/test_queryparams.py tests/test_content.py -q` (142 passed) and Ruff checks pass.
